# Chandra, Chill of Compliance's first +1: "Surveil 1. If you put a noncreature, nonland card into your graveyard this way,
# put that card into your hand." Turn 1: Lightning Bolt is put into the graveyard and returns to the hand. Turn 3: an Island
# put there stays (a land). Turn 5: Aerial Doombot put there stays (an artifact creature is a creature). Turn 7: Mox Pearl,
# an artifact that is no creature, returns. Turn 9: Brainstorm is left on top: nothing goes to the graveyard, so nothing
# returns, and Brainstorm is the next card drawn. Each +1 raises Chandra's loyalty by one (CR 606.4).

